<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>

<section xml:id="ch6-section-looking-ahead" xmlns:xi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XInclude">
  <title>Looking ahead</title>

  <p>
    Now we have five unknowns
    (<m>u</m>, <m>v</m>, <m>w</m>, <m>p</m>, and <m>\rho</m>)
    and four equations: the three equations of motion (<xref ref="chapter-5" text="type-global" />)
    and the mass continuity equation (<xref ref="chapter-6" text="type-global" />).
    In Chapter 7, we will consider energy conservation to obtain the necessary additional equation to close the system.
  </p>

</section>